// Bulk Archive Creation Consistent With Collection Staging
// Detects command-line archive tools compressing user or share directories, which is how data is staged before it leaves. Pair with an egress rule to turn this into a high-confidence exfiltration signal.
// techniques: T1560.001   severity: medium
// source: rules/exfiltration/archive-staging-for-exfil.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
Event
| where (((NewProcessName endswith "\\7z.exe" or NewProcessName endswith "\\rar.exe" or NewProcessName endswith "\\winrar.exe") and (CommandLine contains " a " or CommandLine contains " -hp")) and ((CommandLine has_any (dynamic(["\\Users\\", "\\Documents", "\\Desktop", "\\Shares"])))))
